---
// SectionWhatYouKeep.astro - 03 / WHY DEVELOPERS USE IT (Plain-English Edition)
---

<section id="what-you-keep" class="py-20 border-b border-tide-border bg-tide-bg relative scroll-mt-14">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- DevThread-style section label -->
    <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-tide-accent font-mono mb-4">
      03 / WHY DEVELOPERS USE IT
    </div>

    <!-- Header Row -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-tide-text leading-tight font-mono mb-3">
        Built for speed.<br />
        Kept lightweight.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-tide-text-secondary leading-relaxed font-sans">
        Everything you need to manage multiple coding agents comfortably, with none of the bloat.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- DevThread Asymmetric Bento Grid (1 tall featured card left + 4 cards right) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Featured Left Card (5 cols, spans 2 rows) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 rounded-xl border border-tide-accent/40 bg-tide-surface p-7 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden group">
        <!-- Ambient radial glow -->
        <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-tide-accent/15 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div>
          <!-- Icon / Badge -->
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-tide-variant border border-tide-border flex items-center justify-center text-tide-accent mb-6 font-mono font-bold text-lg">
            ⚡
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-tide-text font-mono mb-2">
            Zero Ghost Processes
          </h3>
          
          <div class="text-xs text-tide-accent font-mono mb-4 font-semibold">
            "When you quit an agent, it actually quits."
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-tide-text-secondary leading-relaxed font-sans mb-6">
            TIDE binds child processes directly to the Windows kernel. You'll never have to open Task Manager again just to kill lingering background Node, Python, or Cargo servers holding onto port 3000 or 8080.
          </p>

          <!-- Guarantees list -->
          <div class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs border-t border-tide-border pt-5">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded bg-tide-bg border border-tide-border">
              <span class="text-tide-accent font-bold">100% Process Cleanup</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-tide-success">✓ Automatic</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded bg-tide-bg border border-tide-border">
              <span class="text-tide-text">No Lingering Port Locks</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-tide-success">✓ Clean Ports</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded bg-tide-bg border border-tide-border">
              <span class="text-tide-muted">No Task Manager Hunting</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-tide-accent">Guaranteed</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-tide-border text-[11px] text-tide-muted font-sans flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Protected by native Windows JobObjects</span>
          <a href="/docs#jobobjects" class="text-tide-accent hover:underline font-mono">Learn more &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right 4 Cards (7 cols in a 2x2 grid) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        
        <!-- Card 1: Private Workspaces -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-tide-border bg-tide-surface flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-tide-border-active transition-all group">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-tide-accent mb-2 font-bold">
              // Private Workspaces
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-tide-text font-mono mb-2">
              Code while agents work
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-tide-text-secondary leading-relaxed font-sans">
              Each agent works on its own isolated copy of your code. You can keep writing in your main editor while 2 or 3 agents build features in the background.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-tide-border text-[10px] text-tide-muted font-sans">
            Powered by lightweight Git worktrees
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2: 60 FPS PTY -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-tide-border bg-tide-surface flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-tide-border-active transition-all group">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-tide-accent mb-2 font-bold">
              // Smooth 60 FPS
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-tide-text font-mono mb-2">
              Lag-free terminal
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-tide-text-secondary leading-relaxed font-sans">
              TIDE smoothly paces output so even massive 10,000-line build dumps or streaming AI responses won't lag your screen or delay your keystrokes.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-tide-border text-[10px] text-tide-muted font-sans">
            Instant keystroke response (&lt;25ms)
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 3: Simple Config -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-tide-border bg-tide-surface flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-tide-border-active transition-all group">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-tide-accent mb-2 font-bold">
              // Simple Configuration
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-tide-text font-mono mb-2">
              Custom agent shortcuts
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-tide-text-secondary leading-relaxed font-sans">
              One clean configuration file (<code class="text-tide-accent font-mono text-[11px]">tide.toml</code>) to configure your favorite AI agents, launch commands, and keyboard shortcuts.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-tide-border text-[10px] text-tide-muted font-sans">
            Claude Code, Antigravity, Aider, or custom
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 4: 14 MB Footprint -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-tide-border bg-tide-surface flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-tide-border-active transition-all group">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-tide-accent mb-2 font-bold">
              // Lightweight Binary
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-tide-text font-mono mb-2">
              Starts in &lt;0.5s &middot; ~14 MB RAM
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-tide-text-secondary leading-relaxed font-sans">
              Built from scratch in pure Rust, not Electron. It starts in under half a second and won't hog your laptop's battery or memory.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-tide-border text-[10px] text-tide-muted font-sans">
            Zero Chromium webviews &middot; zero Node overhead
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
